    "detailed_description": "A drug plantation management game with basebuilding and combat elements.<br><br><strong>You start your venture on a plot of land overgrown by a jungle of trees and shrubs.</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clear the jungle with different tools and turn it into farmland  <br></li><li>Grow different drugs such as cannabis, opium, coca, tobacco and more.<br></li><li>Plan your smuggling routes by finding the most efficient node connections.<br></li><li>Defend against police raids with different weapons to protect your plantation<br></li><li>Process different drugs with techniques such as drying, chemistry, brewing<br></li><li>Use the resources in your area to craft tools, weapons and traps.<br></li><li>Hire workers to farm, process, research or guard the plantation.<br></li><li>Construct huts to house workers, factory buildings and defensive posts.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A drug plantation management game with basebuilding and combat elements.<br><br><strong>You start your venture on a plot of land overgrown by a jungle of trees and shrubs.</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clear the jungle with different tools and turn it into farmland  <br></li><li>Grow different drugs such as cannabis, opium, coca, tobacco and more.<br></li><li>Plan your smuggling routes by finding the most efficient node connections.<br></li><li>Defend against police raids with different weapons to protect your plantation<br></li><li>Process different drugs with techniques such as drying, chemistry, brewing<br></li><li>Use the resources in your area to craft tools, weapons and traps.<br></li><li>Hire workers to farm, process, research or guard the plantation.<br></li><li>Construct huts to house workers, factory buildings and defensive posts.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A drug plantation management game with basebuilding, strategy and combat elements. Expand your plantation, hire workers, and plan new smuggling routes. But be ready to face a heavy response by law enforcement by hiring guards, buying weapons and building defences.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Lithuanian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
